WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.860
<i>On May 16, 1770,</i>

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:35.210
<i>the wedding of the Dauphin,
Louis-Auguste and Marie Antoinette,</i>

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.100
<i>was held in a chapel inside Versailles,</i>

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:42.350
<i>before six thousand members
of the nobility and clergy.</i>

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.360
Next is the signing of the marriage contract.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.680
How awful! A stain on the marriage contract!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.220
It's unheard of.

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:23.920
Could it be an ominous sign for this marriage?

