00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.910
episode

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.910
"Sparks Fly at Versailles"

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.580
Easy! Easy now.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.000
Good, good...

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.790
My Lady!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.790
Please wait!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.340
For Heaven's sake, My Lady!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:18.070
My Lady!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:25.310
You are aware that Lady Antoinette is appearing at the Versailles court for the first time today?

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.980
Mind my manners, right?

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.310
I know, Nanna.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.770
Y-Yes. As long as you remember...

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.220
Grandma...

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:35.480
Oscar isn't a child anymore.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.440
Lady Oscar!

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.920
By the way, Oscar... I mean, Lady Oscar!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:50.550
I've heard your popularity has soared at court,
ever since you rescued Lady Antoinette.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.640
You'd better be careful.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.570
The ladies will be chasing after
you from all directions.

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.400
You've become quite the chatterbox, André.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:11.860
My!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.800
Lady Oscar...!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:18.320
Look, it's Lady Oscar.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.160
She's always so dashing and stunning!

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:26.970
Lady Oscar, we heard you did
a marvelous job at the Rhine.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:29.660
How many savages did you slay?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.790
Excuse me.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.540
She's so cold.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:34.080
That's what's so irresistible about her!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.810
If only she were a man...

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.590
I'd never leave her alone!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.850
No! You shouldn't go into places like that!

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.810
That's enough, Lady Antoinette!

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:52.260
See? I'm getting scolded because
you were being naughty.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:52.860
Bad!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:53.810
Honestly...!

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.300
This isn't the time for that!

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.360
There's one more important
thing I forgot to mention—

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.140
Please listen.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:06.410
Here at Versailles, during formal occasions, a lady of lower rank...

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.240
...may not address a lady of higher rank first under any circumstance.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:12.910
How terribly inconvenient.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.090
No.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.920
Since the Queen has passed away,

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:21.170
as the Dauphine, you are the highest
ranking lady at court, Lady Antoinette.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.760
Me?

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:24.060
Yes.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:29.720
Next in line are His Majesty's daughters,
and then the Dauphin's younger sister.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.840
Everyone will be waiting for you to address them,

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.680
so please be gracious and greet them.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:39.690
<i>As the highest ranking lady at court,</i>

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.140
<i>everyone is waiting for me to address them!</i>

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.980
<i>Oh, how wonderful!</i>

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:57.290
Presenting His Royal Highness,
the Dauphin and Dauphine!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:19.180
My, what a refined and beautiful lady.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.690
Look at how light and elegant her steps are.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.460
She certainly carries herself like an Austrian princess born from royal lineage.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.360
So elegant and beautiful.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.230
Yes, she isn't the slightest bit intimidated.

00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:31.660
She possesses such dignity and poise.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.070
<i>Everyone is looking at me.</i>

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:39.200
<i>With their eyes wide open, they're
clamoring in amazement at my presence!</i>

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.440
<i>Everyone is captivated by my beauty!</i>

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.040
<i>This is wonderful!</i>

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:48.040
<i>I truly am the Queen of Versailles!</i>

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.450
Your Highness, shall we dance?

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:13.140
I-I d-don't d-dance...

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.170
Feel free to go dance if you'd like, Antoinette.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.200
<i>My...!</i>

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:25.520
<i>Oscar!</i>

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.840
<i>I knew she'd come!</i>

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.870
<i>What is wrong with this woman?!</i>

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:43.840
<i>What an arrogant attitude!</i>

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:46.730
<i>She's a statuesque beauty, but somehow vulgar.</i>

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.650
Oscar!

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:58.830
How are you this evening?

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.020
Fine, thank you.

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:04.250
I'm glad to see that Your Highness
is also well this evening.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.730
Look over there!

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:12.560
Lady Antoinette spoke to Lady Oscar first!

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:16.020
We should approach her so we,
can be addressed, as well.

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.430
Say, Oscar.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:27.860
Oscar, that woman staring at me from
over there, what is her position at court?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.770
That is Madame du Barry.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.650
She is not the type of woman that
Your Highness should concern herself with.

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.890
<i>But she's surrounded by so many people...</i>

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.690
<i>...and is acting as though she were Queen.</i>

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:44.710
<i>Why is everyone bowing to her?</i>

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.290
Well then.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.670
Hey, look, André.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:57.270
Her aunt-in-laws, who despise Madame du Barry, as if she were a snake or a frog, are on the move.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.100
Do you sense a storm coming, as well?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.680
I see.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.640
If Lady Antoinette were to learn the situation
surrounding Madame du Barry...

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.250
...I wonder what might happen.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:13.990
What?!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.700
His Majesty's mistress?!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.860
It's true.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:22.120
In fact, she was born as a lowly commoner and
was a whore in some filthy area of the city.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.460
What is a whore?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:28.170
A woman who sells her body to
men for money. A prostitute!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.050
Why is such an indecent woman at Versailles?!

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:38.340
<i>In Austria, my mother would have such women
lashed and thrown into reformatories!</i>

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:44.390
According to rumors, after she weaseled
money out of her patrons,

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.960
she used that money to trick a prestigious
member of the nobility, Count du Barry,

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:50.400
into agreeing to a paper marriage.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:53.990
The following day, she poisoned the Count.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:09.420
Poisoned?! How terrifying!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.480
Yes.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:14.850
After she became a Countess, she began
appearing at Court as if nothing happened,

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.590
and seduced His Majesty
with her seductive beauty.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:22.390
Ever since she became his mistress, she assigns
and dismisses ministers as she pleases.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:25.400
She spends lavishly and lives in the lap of luxury.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:28.770
His Majesty has pushed our,
his own daughters', protests aside...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.030
...and is fully under that woman's control.

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:37.010
Yes, and because everyone
bows down to win her favor...

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:40.750
She thinks she's Queen and does
as she pleases! It's despicable!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.550
<i>What... What a presumptuous woman!</i>

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.910
<i>So that's why she was staring at me like that!</i>

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:51.560
But even if she possesses power
and regards you as her rival...

00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:57.290
...she is no match for you, as you are a
true royal and also the future Queen.

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:59.130
It's best you ignore her!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.990
Yes, ignore her completely!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:37.160
<i>That Austrian brat never
addressed me in the end.</i>

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:45.440
Shut up!

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.610
M-Madame, what happened?

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.280
It's nothing! Leave me alone!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.230
What did you think of Antoinette's
debut at court, du Barry?

00:12:08.230 --> 00:12:11.240
Seems she was incredibly popular, wasn't she?

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.360
Oh, was she?

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:14.640
Of course she was.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:19.420
Antoinette has captured the hearts of
everyone in the palace in just one day!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.680
I hate redheaded brats like her!

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.150
Oh, come on. Antoinette isn't a redhead.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.300
She's a beautiful blonde.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:31.320
Compared to my hair, she's a redhead.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.580
I guess you're right.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.690
What the...?

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.610
What happened here, du Barry?

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.020
Nothing.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:41.820
Anyway, you two!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.110
Y-Yes!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:49.160
Stop standing there idly and bring me every
single one of Paris' top designers now!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.790
A-All of them?!

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.980
I said now! Hurry!

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.120
Hurry up and go!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:54.940
Y-Yes!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.950
<i>I will not be out-shined by that brat.</i>

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:07.220
<i>I'll have an incredible dress made
that'll make that brat's face turn pale.</i>

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:18.570
My!

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:19.610
Oh!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:21.870
So beautiful!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.310
How gorgeous!

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:25.950
I hope you are all feeling well today?

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.180
Madame du Barry's dress is stunning!

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:36.140
Oh, yes! I've never seen such
a magnificent dress before!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.320
<i>That little redhead isn't here.</i>

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.650
Where could she be?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.240
Look, it's Lady Oscar!

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:59.280
My, she's as dashing as ever today!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.350
Lady Oscar is so cold.

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.400
She never talks to us.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:09.650
Oh, Oscar!

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:10.780
Are you feeling well?

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:11.880
Yes.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:17.160
Oscar, you don't converse or care
to dance like everyone else.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.130
Why is that?

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:19.930
Well...

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:22.380
Say, why don't you come to the
salon in the afternoon sometime?

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:25.000
With all due respect, Lady Antoinette,

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:27.420
I may be a woman, but I'm also a military officer.

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:30.200
My job is not to converse,

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.140
but only to protect the royal family of France.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.390
<i>Oh...!</i>

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.040
Please excuse me.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:46.650
Hey, why didn't you accept
the Dauphine's invitation?

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.000
Getting an invitation to Lady Antoinette's salon...

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.930
...is practically a guarantee
that you'll be promoted.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.530
André!

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:59.100
You mean to say you have the same mindset
as those corrupt nobles at court?! Well?!

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:03.040
If you weren't Nanna's grandson, I'd smack
you across the face once or twice!

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:24.430
<i>That little redhead didn't
know my position at court,</i>

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:27.120
<i>so she just forgot to address me last time.</i>

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:30.670
<i>I will make it clear to her today.</i>

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.700
Say, everyone.

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:35.830
I'll tell you a very special story today.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.080
My, what could it be?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.210
What is it about?

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.750
Oh, hurry! Please tell us!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:43.850
Say, everyone.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.320
Would you like to come over here?

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:48.060
My aunts are planning something fun!

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.220
We're discussing our plans
to go see a play together.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.620
Yes, a play!

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:54.140
Oh, really?

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:57.760
Sounds wonderful!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:04.130
U-Um, Madame du Barry, please excuse me.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:05.340
Me too...

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:06.960
Please excuse us.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:11.410
Please excuse me, as well.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.170
Me too...

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:22.520
Say, have a look at Madame du Barry.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:25.080
Yes, she has such a scowl it's frightening.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:30.060
Come to think of it, Lady Antoinette
hasn't addressed Madame du Barry yet.

00:16:30.060 --> 00:16:35.030
She may have His Majesty's affection
and wield the most power at court,

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:38.070
but strictly speaking, she is not a true lady of high position.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:43.470
Also, it will never be possible for
her to address the Dauphine first.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.590
<i>That pompous Austrian brat.</i>

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.550
<i>She isn't...</i>

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:02.650
<i>She isn't planning on ignoring me
in front of the entire Court, is she?!</i>

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.470
Oh, come on. Don't be silly.

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:14.060
She's deliberately ignoring just you?

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:18.060
I'm sure it's just a simple misunderstanding.

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:20.010
No, she's doing it on purpose.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:24.020
Come on, she's only a child who just turned 14.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:27.380
She's a 14-year-old child, but because she's the Dauphine,

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.950
I have to wait until she addresses me.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:34.240
Do you have any idea what
the entire Court is saying?

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:39.490
That little redhead is challenging me.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.450
It's all just your imagination!

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:49.880
<i>She's challenging me,</i>

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.910
<i>the woman who can even control the King!</i>

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.170
<i>Fine then! Just you watch!</i>

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.770
Hello, Countess Maurois.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:08.080
Countess Maurepas, it's another
beautiful day today, isn't it?

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:10.360
Hello, Duke Orléans.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.930
Indeed, the weather is
splendid today, Lady Antoinette.

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:19.970
Say, Marquise Rovere and Marquise Lamballe,

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:22.780
would you like to go for a walk
in the park's forest this afternoon?

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.210
My, what a wonderful idea!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:27.780
After all, Versailles Park is most
beautiful during this time of year.

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:28.580
We'd love to join you.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.500
Madame Rosen and Madame Maintenon.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.350
Please come to the card game tonight.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:35.460
Y-Yes, I'll be happy to visit.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:37.720
The Dauphin will be attending, as well.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:39.790
My, what an honor!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:40.690
Well then.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:19:00.480
Oh, it seems the snotty brat
has a cute side, after all.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:04.110
She finally realized that she
forgot to address me.

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:12.210
Hello, Madame Joule.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:14.220
My, Lady Antoinette!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:44.520
It seems the Dauphine has decided
to ignore the Madame completely.

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:46.390
Wh-What to do...

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:49.000
My wife is a fan of Lady Antoinette.

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:53.400
We must remember that
His Majesty is on the Madame's side.

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:54.960
It's a headache for both of us.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:58.500
Even so, I wonder whose side
Oscar François will take?

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:01.930
Wouldn't it be Madame du Barry,
whom she's known longer?

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:06.010
Oh? She's from the distinguished
Jarjayes family though.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.930
I think she'll side with Lady Antoinette.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.820
However, if His Majesty
were to pass away now,

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:13.900
the Dauphin will ascend to the throne.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:17.400
If that happens, Lady Antoinette
will become Queen.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:23.370
Still, if we aligned ourselves against Madame du Barry now, she might make us pay dearly for it.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:32.440
Seems those obsequious nobles
are panicked about what to do,

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:34.250
trying to decide who they'd
gain more by standing with.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.310
Oscar, whose side are you taking?

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:38.670
All the Ladies of the court are curious to find out.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.900
I, Oscar...

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:42.720
...won't take either side.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:48.110
I plan on sitting back and watching
this entertaining duel of the Ladies.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.270
Duke Orléans.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:05.860
Do you plan on embarrassing me, too?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.010
Of course not, Countess du Barry.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:09.840
I've come to help you.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:12.640
You, the Dauphin's own cousin, will help me?

00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:13.440
Indeed.

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:17.570
I also think Lady Antoinette's
behavior has been reprehensible.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:22.630
There is only one way to out-do Antoinette.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.300
What?!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.270
My mother as Madame du Barry's
lady-in-waiting?!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.570
That's right. I just heard it in town.

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:46.040
Wicked woman!

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:48.530
She's trying to force me to take her side!

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:49.880
Yes.

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:52.950
She noticed your popularity,
so by having you on her side,

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.840
she's trying to draw in all the
ladies onto her side, as well.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.150
I won't have it!

00:21:57.150 --> 00:22:00.630
I don't want my mother getting dragged
into the female power struggle at court!

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:01.840
Oscar.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:08.340
This is an order from His Majesty.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:23.270
<i>This is an order from His Majesty...</i>

